{
  "_comment": "forge-lab project-level Claude Code settings. Uses bypassPermissions mode so spawned agents (reviewers, workers) run without prompting on every tool use. This is a personal dev project on Adam's machine; the git history is the safety net. No Stop hooks: forge-lab agents do discrete tasks and exit cleanly, the Planning Hub dispatches follow-up work rather than a worker loop. vibe-forge's worker-loop hook is deliberately NOT inherited here.",
